[b]Keep your spare armour sets, your wife's dress and your best food away from the loot.[/b]

In your inventory, press [b]New chest[/b], give it a name, and put in what you want kept apart. A chest shows in your item list like any other goods; click it and it opens on the left, where you move things in and out.

[size=5][b]What a chest does[/b][/size]
What is in a chest is [b]out of your party's reach[/b]:
[list]
[*]never sold, not even by "sell all"
[*]never eaten
[*]never equipped by companions or used to upgrade troops
[*]never counted as trade goods
[/list]
It still [b]weighs what it holds[/b], so your party is as fast or as slow as before. Hover a chest to see what is inside, its weight and worth.

Chests open from your own inventory (the I key, on the map or in town). Up to 50 chests. Horses and other animals stay out.

[size=5][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/mountandblade2bannerlord/mods/2006]Harmony[/url] (required)
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/mountandblade2bannerlord/mods/2102]UIExtenderEx[/url] (required)
[/list]

[size=5][b]Install[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Vortex:[/b] click Mod Manager Download and enable it.
[*][b]Manual:[/b] extract the zip into [i]Mount & Blade II Bannerlord\Modules\[/i], so you get [i]Modules\ItemChests\SubModule.xml[/i]. Enable it in the launcher, below Harmony and UIExtenderEx.
[/list]

[size=5][b]Good to know[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Game v1.4.8, singleplayer. Works with or without War Sails.
[*]Safe to add mid-campaign. [b]Before removing it, empty your chests:[/b] without the mod they turn into "Trash Item" and what was inside is gone.
[*]Also on the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3822341629]Steam Workshop[/url] and on [url=https://github.com/TraxData313/item-chests/releases/latest]GitHub Releases[/url]. Same files.
[/list]

Bugs or a mod it fights with: tell me in the comments or on [url=https://github.com/TraxData313/item-chests/issues]GitHub[/url]. How it works in detail: [url=https://github.com/TraxData313/item-chests/blob/main/docs/TECHNICAL.md]docs/TECHNICAL.md[/url].

